    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244350/extras/6f05c7709bda1187826ed4c779a768da.poster.avif?t=1751428126\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244350/extras/6f05c7709bda1187826ed4c779a768da.webm?t=1751428126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244350/extras/6f05c7709bda1187826ed4c779a768da.mp4?t=1751428126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Burial of Shortcake&quot; is an <strong>unpredictable story</strong>.\u00a0 It is a new visual novel with characters which are created/designed by voice actor Nozomi Sasaki, whose &quot;<strong>expressiveness</strong>&quot; shines throughout her career as a performer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can click on the screen to continue to read the story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244350/extras/02e2dd88827a6d6a6d5362fea21644a3.poster.avif?t=1751428126\" width=494 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244350/extras/02e2dd88827a6d6a6d5362fea21644a3.webm?t=1751428126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244350/extras/02e2dd88827a6d6a6d5362fea21644a3.mp4?t=1751428126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: Crime suspense, visual novel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing time: 5 to 7 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Options: none. One way</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244350/extras/f8449fd0b9bdd13445eb6238dcedf44c.poster.avif?t=1751428126\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244350/extras/f8449fd0b9bdd13445eb6238dcedf44c.webm?t=1751428126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244350/extras/f8449fd0b9bdd13445eb6238dcedf44c.mp4?t=1751428126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Sweat, dirt, blood. It all goes in my mouth and makes me want to throw up.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One night, the main character, Kisetsu, sneaks into a mountain forest in the middle of the night in order to bury the corpse for a certain reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A snow shovel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shopping cart from a supermarket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then he wrapped something in a blue sheet and hid it - [that].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surrounded by \u201cthem\u201d, he started digging a hole, was covered with all the sweat and swallowing blood and dirt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWhat is that\u2026?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He just realized that there is no end beyond the hole and beyond the tragedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is about \u201cthe world\u201d beyond the tragedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crime Suspense Visual Novel--&quot;The Burial of Shortcake&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Staff</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planning, Scenario Direction, Movie\u00a0 Luke Saito</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Design\u00a0 Nozomi Sasaki</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music\u00a0 Shiori Kamikubo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still Illustrations\u00a0 Nozomi Sasaki , Onoyama , Ayabe Eriko</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English Translation\u00a0\u00a0Moeka Tamura , Sayaka Matsushima</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244350/extras/6f05c7709bda1187826ed4c779a768da.poster.avif?t=1751428126\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244350/extras/6f05c7709bda1187826ed4c779a768da.webm?t=1751428126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244350/extras/6f05c7709bda1187826ed4c779a768da.mp4?t=1751428126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Burial of Shortcake&quot; is an <strong>unpredictable story</strong>.\u00a0 It is a new visual novel with characters which are created/designed by voice actor Nozomi Sasaki, whose &quot;<strong>expressiveness</strong>&quot; shines throughout her career as a performer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can click on the screen to continue to read the story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244350/extras/02e2dd88827a6d6a6d5362fea21644a3.poster.avif?t=1751428126\" width=494 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244350/extras/02e2dd88827a6d6a6d5362fea21644a3.webm?t=1751428126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244350/extras/02e2dd88827a6d6a6d5362fea21644a3.mp4?t=1751428126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: Crime suspense, visual novel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing time: 5 to 7 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Options: none. One way</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong><